{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/laserade_contest_art.png?t=1743610156\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have entered a contest to win a lifetime supply of Suga soft drinks, hosted graciously by Suga Corp. All you have to do is demonstrate how far you'll go to win the prize and in the process provide invaluable data for the Suga market research team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/laser_drone_clip.gif?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch out for lasers.</strong> One wrong move and you'll be zapped into oblivion. You think these drones care about you? Concern for your health is not part of their programming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/soda_can_clip.gif?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect all the Suga cans.</strong> Caffeinated, carbonated, and sugary as hell. Basically nectar for humans in all its synthetic, chemically formulated, and artificial glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/exit_door_screenshot.png?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Then head to the exit.</strong> It will take you to the next level where more laser-y death traps await. Do it before the timer runs out to avoid setting off the explosive chip in your brain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level has a set number of cans to collect, tons of laser drones guarding the cans, and a time limit to complete the level. Each completed level takes you closer to winning the grand prize of unlimited Suga drinks for life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is that worth risking life and laser-severed limb? Of course!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608250?t=1743610156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/ef64114432b683f6bf6da3563f525745cce4dc43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743610156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/8c3f55c488472f92a597e4f180aa0cf02682581e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743610156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/8c3f55c488472f92a597e4f180aa0cf02682581e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743610156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/laserade_contest_art.png?t=1743610156\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have entered a contest to win a lifetime supply of Suga soft drinks, hosted graciously by Suga Corp. All you have to do is demonstrate how far you'll go to win the prize and in the process provide invaluable data for the Suga market research team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/laser_drone_clip.gif?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch out for lasers.</strong> One wrong move and you'll be zapped into oblivion. You think these drones care about you? Concern for your health is not part of their programming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/soda_can_clip.gif?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect all the Suga cans.</strong> Caffeinated, carbonated, and sugary as hell. Basically nectar for humans in all its synthetic, chemically formulated, and artificial glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/extras/exit_door_screenshot.png?t=1743610156\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Then head to the exit.</strong> It will take you to the next level where more laser-y death traps await. Do it before the timer runs out to avoid setting off the explosive chip in your brain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level has a set number of cans to collect, tons of laser drones guarding the cans, and a time limit to complete the level. Each completed level takes you closer to winning the grand prize of unlimited Suga drinks for life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is that worth risking life and laser-severed limb? Of course!</p>","developers":["Design Boy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608250/bed9336c0a669f429f4b9b69c0f32206de4c2964/header.jpg?t=1743610156","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116415,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116415/movie480.mp4?t=1743610154","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116415/movie_max.mp4?t=1743610154"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116415/ad6c317e136f807e9ab30a19cd0320b9b4b1e7b5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743610154","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571164